(89, 'What is the standard timeframe for United Worldwide Couriers to arrange an air express pickup?', 'As soon as you complete the registration process and submit a quote request, our staff will start working right away and arrange a pickup at your preferred time. Additionally, you can speak with our support staff directly about urgent consignments so that we can give your reservations top priority.', 'express-air-freight', 2, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(90, 'Which types of cargo does your Air Express service handle?', 'We handle commercial goods, B2B consignments, e-commerce shipments, high-value goods, industrial parts, and personal import packages. However, each cargo will be handled according to its specific requirements.', 'express-air-freight', 3, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(91, 'How is the air express cost calculated?', 'The shipping cost for air express solutions is calculated on the basis of the weight and dimensions of the cargo, the destination country, and the speed of delivery required. However, volumetric weight is applied where applicable.', 'express-air-freight', 4, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(92, 'Does United Worldwide Couriers manage customs clearance for international air freight?', 'Yes, United Worldwide Courier’s customs brokerage team can handle all export and import documentation, pre-clearance filings, and compliance requirements for every international shipment. This is how we ensure that your cargo clears borders easily.', 'express-air-freight', 5, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(93, 'What happens if my air express shipment is delayed in transit?', 'At each checkpoint, we monitor shipments and spot problems before they get out of hand. The internal coordination team immediately connects with the airline partners and ground handlers to address the situation and, if feasible, reroute or expedite the flight.', 'express-air-freight', 6, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(94, 'Does United Worldwide Couriers offer real-time tracking?', 'Yes, every shipment booked through United Worldwide Couriers is assigned a unique tracking ID. This ID will be accessible through our live dashboard. From there, you can monitor the status of the cargo at every checkpoint.', 'express-air-freight', 7, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(95, 'Does Air Express have a minimum or maximum weight limit for packages?', 'There is no minimum weight to use our air express service. In case of oversized or overweight cargo, the team ensures the best routing and handling options.', 'express-air-freight', 8, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
(96, 'How do I get started with United Worldwide Couriers if I am a first-time customer?', 'First, you have to register your business account on our platform. Then, share your business details. Thereafter, our team will provide a quote and walk you through the entire process.', 'express-air-freight', 9, 1, '2026-05-26 09:45:14', '2026-05-26 09:45:14'),
