(285, 'faq', 'question', 'What happens if my shipment is delayed or stuck?', 11, '2026-05-08 09:07:23'),
(286, 'faq', 'answer', 'First things first, the team proactively monitors the shipment to identify and resolve potential issues before they escalate. Still, if an issue occurs, the internal team coordinates with the partners to resolve the situation quickly.', 11, '2026-05-08 09:07:23'),
